# L1 (the 262k exactness ladder on the AUDITED levers arm, POOLED): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-audit (the verify audits on PLUS the fused-commit, verify-glue and draft-singles audits, the nine levers, the quad blocks: the levers
# first run at a 262,144 capacity with page width 4,096 HERE, so the lever audits must see the long prompts), the strict matrix over LADDER8_262K = 4,096 / 32,768 /
# 131,072 / 261,856 / 16,384 / 65,536 / 200,000 / 253,920 with 256 tokens out (L9b of tp4-262k8-jobs, retargeted from the 8x262k-gate). The reservations total 15,135 blocks of the 19,967 usable (pool
# 19,968; the gate arms run QWEN_FAST_EXTENT_AUDIT=1, so an ordered-writer or K64j error past 131k is an [EXTENT-AUDIT] MISMATCH): no hold is expected, every seat is live at once and judged on its own text against its solo run; five full windows no longer fit at once, which this ladder never asks.
# READ: strict on eight seats, the extent audit clean on all four chips, ZERO audit mismatches (extent, verify T1/T2, fused commit, vglue, draft singles), every KV reservation line fitting (running + reserved <= pool), no DRAM hold with a seat free.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; attach 15-40 min; the arms 3-4 hours: 300 min. SOFT job, run after the timing pair and the profile (a failure here must not cancel the timing result).
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/262k8 eight-seat 262k development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/262k8 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-best-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/262k8 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-best-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best-audit
C2_GATE_PLAN=matrix
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=4096,32768,131072,261856,16384,65536,200000,253920
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=256
C2_GATE_JIT=record
C2_GATE_AUDITS=extent
